## Conclusion

Patient feedback is most valuable when it leads to better understanding, thoughtful prioritisation, and measurable action.

A systematic analysis process helps healthcare organisations move beyond collecting opinions towards learning from patients and improving the care they receive.

**Listen to feedback. Understand the issues. Act on what matters.**

